01:34:39,674 --> 01:34:40,608
Hmm?

2301
01:34:40,641 --> 01:34:42,943
(peaceful music)

2302
01:34:42,977 --> 01:34:44,845
Time to breed
the master race.

2303
01:34:46,681 --> 01:34:49,450
We'll make some great
tennis players some day.

2304
01:34:49,483 --> 01:34:50,451
The end.

2305
01:34:50,484 --> 01:34:51,452
- Now waffles?
- No more movie.

2306
01:34:51,485 --> 01:34:52,653
(whistling)
Oh, waffles.

2307
01:34:52,687 --> 01:34:54,455
I love waffles. Yay!

2308
01:34:54,955 --> 01:34:59,960
(doors slamming)

2309
01:35:01,996 --> 01:35:03,998
Waffles! Waffles!
Waffles! Waffles!

2310
01:35:04,031 --> 01:35:05,132
Join us, everybody.

2311
01:35:05,166 --> 01:35:06,801
Come on Cambot,
gimme triple berry.

2312
01:35:06,834 --> 01:35:11,806
(fast piano music)

2313
01:35:30,391 --> 01:35:31,726
Serve me up another, please.

2314
01:35:33,327 --> 01:35:34,829
Top mine off
with runny cheese!

2315
01:35:36,363 --> 01:35:37,865
Chili waffles suit me fine!

2316
01:35:39,400 --> 01:35:41,335
Wash me down
with Aunt Jemima?

2317
01:35:47,508 --> 01:35:48,843
What do you think, sirs?

2318
01:35:49,677 --> 01:35:52,146
Let's face it,
sticky fingers.

2319
01:35:52,179 --> 01:35:55,850
Waffles are nothing more than
a vehicle for butter and syrup.

2320
01:35:55,883 --> 01:35:57,151
(laughing)

2321
01:35:57,184 --> 01:35:58,185
What?

2322
01:35:58,219 --> 01:35:59,487
- They are not!
- Just shut up!

2323
01:35:59,520 --> 01:36:01,055
Hey, you watch your
mouth about waffles!

2324
01:36:01,088 --> 01:36:03,324
(laughing) I got you!

2325
01:36:03,357 --> 01:36:05,659
Now, Frank, I want
you to set this up

2326
01:36:05,693 --> 01:36:07,495
so they get a
high-voltage shock,

2327
01:36:07,528 --> 01:36:09,830
every time someone says waffle.

2328
01:36:09,864 --> 01:36:10,831
(laughing)

2329
01:36:10,865 --> 01:36:14,168
Why? Has someone been
saying waffles a lot?

2330
01:36:14,201 --> 01:36:17,838
(zapping)
(screaming)

2331
01:36:17,872 --> 01:36:23,077
(Mystery Science Theater
3000 theme music)

2332
01:37:18,432 --> 01:37:20,401
But you don't understand!

2333
01:37:20,434 --> 01:37:21,836
I'm a prince!

